# Intentional embedded-library policy: the project links libbpf, libelf,
# libz and libzstd statically (hermetic .toolchain dependencies, no runtime
# system libraries except libc). This is a deliberate architecture decision,
# not an accidental vendoring: the static copies are pinned by
# tools/bootstrap-build-deps.sh and rebuilt from distro sources. libz is the
# only one Lintian's heuristic detects.
curtsy: embedded-library zlib [usr/bin/curtsy]
